# L §5.14 Parts, A hole in a term (tally 2.3, #247; C13's clause, the lead's ruling 1; planner/c3/parts.tally): a
# movement at x whose day is a hole makes every take at x undecided, as a hole amount's arrival does (L §5.10,
# L5_10_parts_hole_arrival): inc's day is a hole, so out's take from acc is undecided and a read of it by owner is the
# hole; pinned, each day gives its own answer (50.00 of ania's before the take, 0.00 after). Before: took_ania printed
# 0.00 DUK, one day's answer, where a pin before the take gives 50.00 DUK.
=== m.tally
model parts
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source src "test"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

kind persons: parties

kind cash_accounts: place one min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(DUK)
  takes k for w order (if k.owner == ania then 0 else 1)

place acc: cash_accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2000-01-01..

input got: money DUK

input d_in: date

input d_out: date

input a_out: money DUK

def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule hers = (if p == ania then 1 else 0)

move inc: transfers
  on d_in
  at d_out
  leg cash from world to acc amount got

move out: transfers
  on d_out
  at d_out
  leg cash from acc to world amount a_out

ask took_ania: out.cash.amount of ania
ask took_tomek: out.cash.amount of tomek
ask took_ania_before: out.cash.amount of ania with d_in = 2025-02-01
ask took_ania_after: out.cash.amount of ania with d_in = 2025-04-01
ask took_tomek_before: out.cash.amount of tomek with d_in = 2025-02-01
ask took_tomek_after: out.cash.amount of tomek with d_in = 2025-04-01
ask left_tomek: bal(acc, 2025-12-31) of tomek
ask left_tomek_before: bal(acc, 2025-12-31) of tomek with d_in = 2025-02-01
ask left_tomek_after: bal(acc, 2025-12-31) of tomek with d_in = 2025-04-01

version cast
  cite src
  known 2021-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1991-03-14..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1989-07-02..

version facts
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2021-01-01
  opening[acc] of tomek = 100.00 at 2025-01-01 start
  opening[acc] = 100.00 at 2025-01-01 start
  d_in = ?"which day did the money come in?"
  d_out = 2025-03-01
  a_out = 50.00
  got = 100.00
=== expect
left_tomek: ?"which day did the money come in?" (d_in)
...
took_ania: ? ...
...
took_ania_after: 0.00 DUK
  cut 2026-01-15
took_ania_before: 50.00 DUK
  cut 2026-01-15
took_tomek: ? ...
...
